# ============================================================================
# Database / data
# ============================================================================
*.sqlite
*.sqlite3
*.db
# The bare `data/` rule used to match every directory called "data"
# anywhere in the tree, which accidentally hid two real content dirs
# from git: frontend/app/about/data (the /about/data route's
# page.tsx) and apidocs/src/content/docs/data (Astro content). Vercel
# never built the about/data route because the file wasn't in the
# repo. Scoped now to repo-root data dumps + explicit backend path.
/data/
/backend/data/
postgres-data/
redis-data/
*.dump

